	(text "F407 rotator controller\nRoot sheet. This PR is the rotor interface and the AC motor drive only.\nThe processor sheet and the power sheet are not drawn yet.\nNo-connects on these sheet pins are the waiver for that.\nPower arrives later on +5V and +3V3. PWR_FLAG on the child sheet marks that.\nDo not copy hardware/controller/ (imported V4). It stays as reference."
